WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.360
A small edit to a shared helper can reach
code that never appears in your diff.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.817
The agent uses Review to look up
callers of the changed greeting helper.

3
00:00:11.817 --> 00:00:14.517
The command line entry
point is on the list,

4
00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:17.400
so that’s a path you can
check before shipping.

5
00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:25.008
Use the callers as a guide.

6
00:00:25.008 --> 00:00:29.447
Pick a check that actually goes through
the part of the program they use.
